more comfortable.

66
00:04:55,514 --> 00:04:58,266
Fine. I'll wear yours.

67
00:05:07,028 --> 00:05:08,279
This is my thong. 

68
00:05:08,946 --> 00:05:11,365
I feel alive in my thong.

69
00:05:14,202 --> 00:05:15,661
I can run in my thong.

70
00:05:52,538 --> 00:05:55,007
Naughty, naughty lawn boy.

71
00:05:58,963 --> 00:06:01,299
Wake up, honey.
You got to go to practice. Get up!

72
00:06:09,767 --> 00:06:12,227
8:00 means 8:00.

73
00:06:17,442 --> 00:06:21,488
I'm sure most of you spent last night
reading the Cape League program...

74
00:06:21,656 --> 00:06:26,453
checking each other's stats,
staring up at that strange ceiling...

75
00:06:26,365 --> 00:06:29,867
