82
00:07:06,918 --> 00:07:10,004
You are now the Chatham A's, gentlemen,
which means you are...

83
00:07:12,633 --> 00:07:14,009
Ryan Dunne.

84
00:07:14,217 --> 00:07:17,188
I'm sorry. I was here, 
I was there.

85
00:07:21,142 --> 00:07:22,560
Knock it off!

86
00:07:25,981 --> 00:07:28,775
Outfielders, with Coach Sully.

87
00:07:28,901 --> 00:07:30,862
Infielders, with Coach Ward.

88
00:07:31,071 --> 00:07:32,864
Pitchers to the bullpen. Move!

89
00:07:43,043 --> 00:07:44,961
Coach, what happened was...

90
00:07:46,046 --> 00:07:47,756
Strike two.

91
00:07:48,841 --> 00:07:51,009
I know what happened at that junior 
college in Framingham.

92
00:07:51,094 --> 00:07:52,845
I thought I'd give you a chance anyway.

93
00:07:53,346 --> 00:07:55,349
- Coach.
- Shut up and listen.

94
00:07:56,558 --> 00:08:00,479
This summer league is one step away
from getting paid to play baseball.

95
00:08:03,149 --> 00:08:09,013
Look. I know you've had a bad loss
in your personal life. I'm sorry about that.

96
00:08:10,825 --> 00:08:15,413
But I don't have any room on this roster
for some hardheaded, local wiseass...

97
00:08:15,622 --> 00:08:19,043
