apply to him.

98
00:08:19,836 --> 00:08:23,339
So, like I said: "Strike two."

99
00:09:29,333 --> 00:09:32,045
Mr. Parrish, remember my son Ryan?

100
00:09:32,128 --> 00:09:33,170
How are you doing?

101
00:09:34,089 --> 00:09:38,010
Fellows, could you do me a favor
and not park trucks on the main driveway?

102
00:09:37,952 --> 00:09:41,429
Just use the service drive from now on,
would you? Thanks.

103
00:09:48,146 --> 00:09:51,483
I drove by the Chamberlains'. I thought
you were going to do their lawn this morning.

104
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,778
I had practice.

105
00:09:55,739 --> 00:09:57,240
How's the coach?

106
00:09:57,992 --> 00:10:00,370
I thought I told you not to 
talk to him.

107
00:10:00,453 --> 00:10:01,745
