as the type to find that funny.

116
00:11:09,867 --> 00:11:11,994
No more talking to the coach, got it?

117
00:11:12,078 --> 00:11:17,501
Fine. Can I tell Pop about the skirt?
He'd be so proud.

118
00:11:18,586 --> 00:11:21,213
