124
00:11:42,990 --> 00:11:46,034
Dodgers offered me $2,000,000.
That's chump change.

125
00:11:46,785 --> 00:11:49,830
I'll pitch a few games here.
I figure they'll come to their senses...

126
00:11:49,914 --> 00:11:51,749
