129
00:12:00,621 --> 00:12:02,221
- No.
- Ryan!

130
00:12:03,038 --> 00:12:05,858
Sorry, I didn't recognize you without your ass
hanging out of your banana hammock...

131
00:12:05,841 --> 00:12:09,086
sobbing, "Sorry, Coach.
Here's my skirt. It was there, I was here."

132
00:12:09,442 --> 00:12:10,742
That was you, right? I'm sorry.

133
00:12:11,439 --> 00:12:15,318
Listen, gentlemen,
we're going to talk to some ladies.

134
00:12:15,194 --> 00:12:18,864
Walk away. Let's go talk to some women.
Come on. Let it go.

135
00:12:19,907 --> 00:12:21,700
Boys, enjoy your cocktails. 
We'll see you later.

136
00:12:21,784 --> 00:12:23,243
Thanks for stopping by.

137
00:12:22,745 --> 00:12:26,790
Meet these ladies, be my wingman,
and you can get out of here.

138
00:12:26,959 --> 00:12:30,296
Lauren Hodges, allow me to introduce you
to a good friend of mine, this is Ryan Dune.

139
00:12:31,097 --> 00:12:32,639
- Dunne!
- Hi.

140
00:12:33,057 --> 00:12:35,976
- And this is her friend...
- Tenley Parrish.

141
00:12:38,730 --> 00:12:40,690
Unfortunately Ryan has to...

142
